{"id":"lx12in4yxbtqph4tncyizonhd","title":"为什么斐波那契数列？","originalTitle":"Why Fibonacci?","summary":"作者在2015年受到Jim Bumgardner视频的启发，开始痴迷于斐波那契数列，并制作了数十个斐波那契设计。每个设计都遵循特定的规则，将LED放置在费马螺旋上，该螺旋与向日葵种子排列相同。作者解释了斐波那契数列和黄金角在LED布局中的应用，以及如何确保LED均匀分布。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://www.evilgeniuslabs.org/why-fibonacci"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T05:35:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T05:58:18.435Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T05:58:18.435Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","教程与观点"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5f498357-e877-40ed-9195-5428c92e9831","title":"Jim Bumgardner启发下，Fibonacci LED设计技术解析费马螺旋与黄金角布局"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5f498357-e877-40ed-9195-5428c92e9831","title":"Jim Bumgardner启发下，Fibonacci LED设计技术解析费马螺旋与黄金角布局"}],"topics":[{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fYUCQ6A2rKr0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}